
# SCTP listener multi-homed on an IPv4 and an IPv6 address

ServerId   TESTING
PassCode   31421
MyEmail    email@example.com
MyAdmin    "Admin, N0CALL"

### Directories #########
# Data directory (for database files)
RunDir data

### Intervals #########
UpstreamTimeout		90s
ClientTimeout		48h

### Listeners ##########
# the SCTP listener is bound to both loopback addresses
Listen "Full feed SCTP"  fullfeed    sctp 127.0.0.1,::1  55152   acl "cfg-aprsc/acl-all.acl"
Listen "Igate port"      igate       tcp  0.0.0.0        55580   acl "cfg-aprsc/acl-all.acl"

### HTTP listener ##########
HTTPStatus 127.0.0.1 55501

### Internals ############
WorkerThreads 3
FileLimit        10000

